{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcUcHurzFtHF6yc9DQfx", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The repo has two Makefile targets for running tests:\n\n**Unit tests only (quick, nothing else needs to be running):**\n```sh\nmake test-fast\n```\nThis runs `python -m pytest -m \"not postgres and not integration\" -q`. It leaves out tests that need the database or the network.\n\n**Full suite:**\n```sh\ndocker compose up db    # start Postgres 16 first, on localhost:5432\nmake test               # python -m pytest -q\n```\n\nThe skipped tests are marked in `pyproject.toml`:\n- `postgres` tests need the database from `docker compose up db`. It uses the database `ledgerline_test` with user and password `ledgerline`.\n- `integration` tests call the payments sandbox over the network.\n\n**Setup:** pytest (version 8.0 or later) is a dev dependency. If it isn't installed yet, run `pip install -e \".[dev]\"` first.\n\nTo run a single file or test, use pytest directly, for example `python -m pytest tests/test_foo.py -k some_name -q`."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 421, "cache_read_input_tokens": 25048, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 421}, "output_tokens": 335, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "e13dc95c-46be-4470-be83-a881087e5a6a", "uuid": "4edc77df-cc8b-4918-a6a4-333561470bc7", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:38:19.174Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcUcHgUt7XaPWynVPXvp"}
